  <data key="d18">ABS</data>
  <data key="d19">Electrical condition-monitoring techniques (i.e., high potential testing, power signature analysis)
            involve measuring changes in system properties such as resistance, conductivity, dielectric strength, and
            potential. Some of the problems that these techniques will help detect are electrical insulation
            deterioration, broken motor rotor bars, and a shorted motor stator lamination.</data>
