of the arrow)
Clean or replace
Clean the pump
Find the leakage, repair the
fault, non-return valve not
submerged
Check data sheet Q/H curve
and NPSH or contact DESMI
As 5
Fit smaller V-belt pulley on
pump. Change RPM of
electric motor</data>
