  <data key="d18">ABS</data>
  <data key="d19">Spray shields are to be fitted around flanged joints, flanged bonnets and any
                 other flanged or threaded connections in lubricating oil piping systems under pressure exceeding
                 1.8 bar (1.84 kgf/cm2, 26 psi) which are located above or near units of high temperature, including
                 boilers, steam pipes, exhaust manifolds, silencers or other equipment required to be insulated in
                 accordance with 4-6-4/15.1.4, and also to avoid oil spray or oil leakage into machinery air intakes
