  <data key="d19">Generator turbines are to be fitted with means to automatically shutoff the turbine steam supply
                 upon failure of the lubricating oil system.</data>
  <data key="d20">E1</data>
  <data key="d21">D32DFA57DA246C016A74B196394A9BFA93A7F94485E8DF768F397482D4C4E507</data>
